'' A non-blank body line that does not begin with the closing line's indentation, byte for
'' byte, is TKO0208: a shallower line, and a TAB where the margin has spaces. No guess at
'' what a tab is worth.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-tokens tests/diagnostics/src/block-string-margin.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: block-string-margin.bas(3,1): error TKO0208: block string line does not start with the closing line's indentation
'' EXPECT-OUT: block-string-margin.bas(4,1): error TKO0208: block string line does not start with the closing line's indentation
'' EXPECT-MAX-DIAG: 2
